      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks Peter, good suggestion. Before coding, I thnk there are two options:\n\n1. Hardcode test paths: Add each skill\u0027s test directory explicitly in CheckRunUnittests (e.g. skills/skill-validator/scripts). Simple but requires updating PRESUBMIT.py every time a new skill with tests is added.\n  \n2. Centralized `agents/testing/ directory`, put all test files there. `GetUnitTestsInDirectory` auto-discovers them without updating PRESUBMIT.py. Better for future extensibility.\n\nI\u0027m leaning towards option 2. WDYT?",
